fzf
===

SHELL KEYS
Work in vi insert and normal mode.

  ctrl-t            Paste the selected files or directories (fd, with a bat preview)
  ctrl-r            Search history (? toggles a preview of long commands)
  alt-c             cd into the selected directory (Left Option is Alt in WezTerm)
  **<Tab>           Fuzzy completion, for example vim **<Tab> or cd **<Tab>

INSIDE FZF
From FZF_DEFAULT_OPTS. They also apply in fzf.vim.

  tab / shift-tab   Mark / unmark (multi-select is on)
  ctrl-a            Select all and accept
  F2                Toggle the preview (hidden by default)
  F3                Open the item in bat (or less)
  ctrl-d / ctrl-u   Half page down / up
  ctrl-y            Copy the selection to the clipboard (macOS only)

DEFAULTS
  A single match is accepted at once (-1)
  The file list is git ls-files in a repo, else fd
